codex
The race is exactly in `upsert`: it merges requested tags into `contact.tags` from search, then PUTs that whole array. I’m adding a regression whose search endpoint deliberately keeps returning an empty-tag snapshot while the contact readback reflects current server state; this reproduces the live timing failure deterministically.
